        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwekala mumpata yamunu mwishina, enu mwashakama hanuheseki, chakanya munawu mpandelu hamapidi mwakatalaŋa, chakemba wumpuja mwakatiyapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova naŋili nindi, Nukuduŋu mikazo-o, mwami nashakama nukutalaŋa, neyi nkanza yitooka yahamwaana, neyi ivu dawuumi dahankanza yahachilaaka chakwaŋula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hachidi chilaaka chakwaŋula kanda chishiki, helaŋa nkenu yinakukumuki dehi, hadiŋi nkenu hihadi mukabu wavinyu wudi nakuya nakwiha, yena hakutetatetaku nyitekeŋu nampoku jakukunkula nachu, hakukunkulaku nyitayi yatandama, hakuyitwala kwacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyilumbikila atujila akumapidi asweja nzala, nianyama ahanu heseki; atujila asweja nzala akachelukilaku mwaka wanvula, anyama ahanu heseki akachelukila kumwaka wanoŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
